==Trivia==
*In Japanese, Archer the Cat is アーチャーネコ ''Āchā Neko'' (Archer Cat), while [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Archer Cat]] is ネコアーチャー ''Neko Āchā'' (Cat Archer).
*Archer the Cat is one of the units to have its description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "Immune to Wave Attacks" was changed to "Immune to Waves".

